Elexon market data
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

`src/bess/data/elexon.py` retrieves GB wholesale and imbalance prices from the
Elexon Insights / BMRS endpoints. No data obtained from Elexon is redistributed
in this repository — the local cache is excluded by .gitignore, and every run
fetches its own copy.

Elexon's terms of use are not reproduced here because they could not be
retrieved at the time of writing, so no licence is asserted on their behalf.
Anyone redistributing data obtained through this client, or using it
commercially, should read Elexon's current terms first. What is verified here is
narrower and stated as such in the README: the endpoints used are publicly
reachable and require no API key.
